gin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1-2{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =4\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(\\sqrt{2}x)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\cdot (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{2}}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-114024/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "de1e3f3a-5a64-573f-8fb1-9952fa36a839"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114024"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114023/selection/f88cee3708563c687c6ddd3d0452a923b46578cd37d4bda981dff8ed3879956d" :answer/id #uuid "2a7fbc93-a0d1-54a6-a36d-45226c125827" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114023/selection/84abbd4e727e02fa513782e56fb50c3dfea832c1c225de4aa989f40ec57e7791" :answer/id #uuid "cf93e1a6-1bbf-5a81-8c7b-5fe67a0988c4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "36\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(6x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114023/selection/4e1320571977cf6984fb6be269dfa35ea466c62a403f8104f9fb41086017e0e0" :answer/id #uuid "db06961f-0dd2-5efc-be06-4e0611964fe0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{36}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(6x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114023/selection/f4127bd19ca861c64e2be267c7d8891c559814a370d47a062717d50b975625bf" :answer/id #uuid "352bf025-f82e-50ad-8c77-25bd6188beb3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(6x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114023/selection/5216429c1327e1c535e86a55b99b1ff593a8bf25f7799c2c83771d7f892a0b9d" :answer/id #uuid "5c97499b-3e30-5cef-a80a-c25520c3e23f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(6x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114023/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "0b9fefbf-0fd1-58ea-a9e5-d4f208246cd5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114023/selection/4e1320571977cf6984fb6be269dfa35ea466c62a403f8104f9fb41086017e0e0" :answer-field/choices ["q-114023/selection/f88cee3708563c687c6ddd3d0452a923b46578cd37d4bda981dff8ed3879956d" "q-114023/selection/84abbd4e727e02fa513782e56fb50c3dfea832c1c225de4aa989f40ec57e7791" "q-114023/selection/4e1320571977cf6984fb6be269dfa35ea466c62a403f8104f9fb41086017e0e0" "q-114023/selection/f4127bd19ca861c64e2be267c7d8891c559814a370d47a062717d50b975625bf" "q-114023/selection/5216429c1327e1c535e86a55b99b1ff593a8bf25f7799c2c83771d7f892a0b9d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114023" :question/id #uuid "71e110b8-dac7-55ea-9c66-c30aaca2c79e" :question/math-academy-id "q-114023" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int \\frac{1}{6\\sqrt{1-36{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "This integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $36{x}^{2}=(6x)^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=6x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=6\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{6}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{6\\sqrt{1-36{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{6}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(6x)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\cdot (\\frac{1}{6}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{36}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{36}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{36}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(6x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-114023/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "de1e3f3a-5a64-573f-8fb1-9952fa36a839"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114023"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-2505"] :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-4{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "This integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $4{x}^{2}=(2x)^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=2x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=2\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-4{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(2x)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\cdot (\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(2x)}{2}+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-49550/selection/7ad3ef567d860135ec398420fdeaea4ffaebdde20ce146b1b70d0010952819ae" :answer/id #uuid "b8363bbb-cc56-5ac6-8d3f-8e98593234ab" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{x}{5})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49550/selection/455f08b293b964281e5563423846e7d9af8f7f2f1523ed5ebf57b45749563e7f" :answer/id #uuid "7db732e0-f117-5d15-8e6c-192e1b8b0c88" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(5x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49550/selection/fc86287e7c1b9b9fbd6f9a887e3855872890cdbdcfc64f35769174a116faed18" :answer/id #uuid "53788ea9-2d45-508b-8be1-dbc999162a1f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(5x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49550/selection/02f58382b2d2c9dfa2b7d819bccab6b0b9922468ca50e193338c7c2440ed93ba" :answer/id #uuid "83968c12-e703-5226-be8b-0715c08ed100" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{x}{5})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49550/selection/bacf1c3208ab26d5a440afad4b802b7d7e040e46b0eb8c1eb615aba39fc8a42c" :answer/id #uuid "eb4c1463-6ab8-54a2-86a8-95b8ee5aa49e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{x}{5})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49550/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "968c70b5-c733-5603-a441-c96bb891841e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-49550/selection/7ad3ef567d860135ec398420fdeaea4ffaebdde20ce146b1b70d0010952819ae" :answer-field/choices ["q-49550/selection/7ad3ef567d860135ec398420fdeaea4ffaebdde20ce146b1b70d0010952819ae" "q-49550/selection/455f08b293b964281e5563423846e7d9af8f7f2f1523ed5ebf57b45749563e7f" "q-49550/selection/fc86287e7c1b9b9fbd6f9a887e3855872890cdbdcfc64f35769174a116faed18" "q-49550/selection/02f58382b2d2c9dfa2b7d819bccab6b0b9922468ca50e193338c7c2440ed93ba" "q-49550/selection/bacf1c3208ab26d5a440afad4b802b7d7e040e46b0eb8c1eb615aba39fc8a42c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-49550" :question/id #uuid "ce76c021-250c-5a67-b73f-f7d925e67c4d" :question/math-academy-id "q-49550" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{1}{25+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Let's rewrite our integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{25+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{25\\cdot (1+{x}^{2}/25)}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{25}\\int \\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}/25}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{25}\\int \\frac{1}{1+(x/5)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis integral resembles the basic integral for inverse tangent\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have ${(\\frac{x}{5})}^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\frac{x}{5}.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{5}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=5\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{25+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{25}\\int \\frac{1}{1+(x/5)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{25}\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\cdot (5\\,\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{1+{u}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{x}{5})+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-49550/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "227abe29-6e31-5afd-b0ca-3b8ed7d8c287"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-49550"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-2507/selection/e5b4431f37f3787f79b79cefc3177f42e59d4b7b40c66fff0092d838e19fde29" :answer/id #uuid "aea0486f-7ecf-5b4b-aaf0-d75ab5ee51ae" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{arcsec}(25x)}{25}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-2507/selection/0a79cf19b348014a886998fe3eb32ef8895ea6d2648fbae5413d81f56ba45af2" :answer/id #uuid "efbd9355-7eca-50ac-9063-b06770bdc7cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(25x)}{25}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-2507/selection/9eacddf6799cffdf1c001a203770e463f20a39d13574a8c8466bb7cbd35541da" :answer/id #uuid "97242a87-2ce3-57fd-928b-28648b62cbc1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(5x)}{5}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-2507/selection/17f9c928b2ca11b61ca7df28022